disguise) to go on your journey with style!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2507990/extras/7467951a0f2d7d766146d8c5ab15d761.avif?t=1732135097\" /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SAVING BETWEEN SESSIONS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play the game in your pace. <strong>The game will always save your progress</strong>, so you can take a break between sessions. Beating the game in one session is just as valuable as beating it in 10 sessions \u2014 no need to start from the bottom every time!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
